---

<Layout
  title="Design"
  description="Not sure what style you want for your remodel? Stronghold's guided design service helps you find your style profile and lock in every key material decision before any work starts."
>
  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ HERO -->
  <section class="selector-hero">
    <div class="selector-hero-inner">
      <div class="hero-content">
        <div class="hero-text">
          <p class="eyebrow">Guided Design</p>
          <h1>Know what you want<br /><span class="accent">before we break ground.</span></h1>
          <p class="hero-sub">
            Most people start a remodel with a vague idea and a Pinterest board. Stronghold's guided design
            process gives you something more useful: a clear style profile, a vocabulary to use in every material
            conversation, and decisions made in the right order before any work starts.
          </p>

          <div class="hero-value-grid">
            <div class="hero-value-item">
              <span class="hero-value-num">01</span>
              <h3 class="hero-value-title">Style Clarity</h3>
              <p class="hero-value-desc">Walk away knowing exactly what style you want — not just "modern-ish" or "warm but clean." A real profile with a palette and design principles you can point to in every material conversation.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-value-item">
              <span class="hero-value-num">02</span>
              <h3 class="hero-value-title">Right Decision Order</h3>
              <p class="hero-value-desc">The Design Wizard guides you through every key material decision in the same sequence professional designers use — so nothing has to be undone because something upstream changed.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-value-item">
              <span class="hero-value-num">03</span>
              <h3 class="hero-value-title">Shared Vocabulary</h3>
              <p class="hero-value-desc">You and your contractor walk into every meeting aligned. No miscommunication, no costly surprises, no "I thought you meant something else" when the tile is already on the wall.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-moodboard">
          <picture>
            <source srcset="/moodboard.webp" type="image/webp" />
            <img
              src="/moodboard.jpg"
              alt="Interior design mood board — warm materials, organic textures, and elevated finishes"
              loading="eager"
              decoding="async"
              width="995"
              height="968"
            />
          </picture>
          <p class="moodboard-caption">Sample mood board</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ HOW IT WORKS -->
  <section class="how-it-works">
    <div class="how-inner">
      <p class="eyebrow">How It Works</p>
      <h2>A starting point, not a contract.</h2>
      <p>Your style profile and design selections give us a shared vocabulary — a reference point so that when we are choosing between two countertop materials or three hardware options, we are not starting from scratch. We will refine and adapt based on your specific space, budget, and what is available.</p>
      <div class="how-steps">
        <div class="how-step">
          <span class="how-num">01</span>
          <h3>Take the photo quiz</h3>
          <p>Five photo-based questions about the spaces and styles that speak to you. No right or wrong answers — just what resonates.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="how-step">
          <span class="how-num">02</span>
          <h3>See your style profile</h3>
          <p>Get your full profile — palette, design DNA, and the guardrail questions that filter every purchase decision you will ever make.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="how-step">
          <span class="how-num">03</span>
          <h3>Work through the wizard</h3>
          <p>The Design Wizard guides you through 7 key decisions — flooring, cabinetry, countertops, tile, lighting, paint, and decor — in the order that prevents costly reversals.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="how-step">
          <span class="how-num">04</span>
          <h3>Build with confidence</h3>
          <p>Walk into every contractor meeting aligned. Clear starting point, shared vocabulary, fewer surprises, and a finished home that actually reflects you.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div id="selector-app" class="selector-app">

    <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════════ PHASE: QUIZ -->
    <div id="phase-quiz">

      <div class="quiz-section-header">
        <div class="quiz-section-header-inner">
          <p class="eyebrow">Style Quiz</p>
          <h2>Find your style in five photos.</h2>
          <p>Each question shows real rooms in the three design styles Stronghold specializes in. Pick the space that feels like home — not what you think you should want.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="progress-bar-wrap">
        <div class="progress-bar-inner">
          <div class="progress-fill" id="quiz-progress-fill" style="width:0%"></div>
        </div>
        <span class="progress-label" id="quiz-progress-label">Question 1 of 5</span>
      </div>

      <div id="quiz-questions-container">
        {quizQuestions.map((q, qi) => (
          <div
            class={`question-block ${qi === 0 ? 'question-block--active' : ''}`}
            id={`question-${q.id}`}
            data-step={q.step}
          >
            <div class="question-inner">
              <p class="question-num">Question {q.step} / {quizQuestions.length}</p>
              <h2 class="question-text">{q.question}</h2>
              <div class={`answers-grid ${q.type === 'image' ? 'answers-grid--image' : 'answers-grid--text'}`}>
                {q.answers.map((a, ai) => (
                  <button
                    class={`answer-btn ${q.type === 'image' ? 'answer-btn--image' : ''}`}
                    data-question={q.id}
                    data-answer={ai}
                    data-weights={JSON.stringify(a.weights)}
                  >
                    {q.type === 'image' && 'image' in a && (
                      <div class="answer-img-wrap">
                        <img src={(a as any).image} alt={a.label} loading="lazy" />
                      </div>
                    )}
                    <span class="answer-label">{a.label}</span>
                  </button>
                ))}
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════════ PHASE: REVEAL -->
    <div id="phase-reveal" style="display:none">
      <div class="reveal-inner">
        <p class="eyebrow">Your Style Profile</p>
        <h2 id="reveal-name" class="reveal-name">—</h2>
        <p id="reveal-tagline" class="reveal-tagline">—</p>
        <div class="reveal-palette-wrap">
          <div class="reveal-palette" id="reveal-palette"></div>
        </div>
        <p id="reveal-description" class="reveal-description">—</p>
        <div class="reveal-dna-wrap">
          <p class="reveal-dna-title">Your Style DNA</p>
          <ul id="reveal-dna" class="reveal-dna"></ul>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal-cta-callout">
          <p class="reveal-cta-callout-text">
            You now have a clear starting point — your style, your palette, and the design
            principles that will guide every material decision. Bring this to your first
            conversation with Stronghold and we will know exactly how to build it.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal-actions">
          <a id="contact-cta-btn" href="/quote?ref=design-quiz" class="btn-primary">Get a Quote &rarr;</a>
          <button id="retake-quiz-btn" class="btn-outline">Retake Quiz</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

</Layout>

<script define:vars={{ styles, quizQuestions }}>
  // ─── State ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  const state = {
    quizStep: 1,
    scores: { 'organic-modern': 0, 'european-modern': 0, 'transitional-modern': 0 },
    selectedStyle: null,
  };

  const TOTAL_QUIZ = 5;

  // ─── Element refs ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  const phaseQuiz   = document.getElementById('phase-quiz');
  const phaseReveal = document.getElementById('phase-reveal');

  // ─── Phase transitions ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  function showPhase(phase) {
    [phaseQuiz, phaseReveal].forEach(el => {
      if (el) el.style.display = 'none';
    });
    if (phase === 'quiz')   { phaseQuiz.style.display   = 'block'; }
    if (phase === 'reveal') { phaseReveal.style.display = 'block'; }
    document.getElementById('selector-app').scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'start' });
  }

  // ─── QUIZ ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  function updateQuizProgress(step) {
    const pct = ((step - 1) / TOTAL_QUIZ) * 100;
    document.getElementById('quiz-progress-fill').style.width = pct + '%';
    document.getElementById('quiz-progress-label').textContent =
      step <= TOTAL_QUIZ ? `Question ${step} of ${TOTAL_QUIZ}` : 'Complete';
  }

  function showQuizQuestion(step) {
    document.querySelectorAll('.question-block').forEach(el => el.classList.remove('question-block--active'));
    const target = document.querySelector(`#quiz-questions-container [data-step="${step}"]`);
    if (target) {
      target.classList.add('question-block--active');
      target.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'start' });
    }
  }

  function finishQuiz() {
    const best = Object.entries(state.scores).sort((a, b) => b[1] - a[1])[0][0];
    state.selectedStyle = best;
    showReveal(best);
  }

  document.querySelectorAll('.answer-btn').forEach(btn => {
    btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const questionId = btn.dataset.question;
      const weights = JSON.parse(btn.dataset.weights);

      document.querySelectorAll(`[data-question="${questionId}"]`).forEach(b => b.classList.remove('answer-btn--selected'));
      btn.classList.add('answer-btn--selected');

      Object.entries(weights).forEach(([id, w]) => {
        state.scores[id] = (state.scores[id] || 0) + Number(w);
      });

      setTimeout(() => {
        if (state.quizStep < TOTAL_QUIZ) {
          state.quizStep++;
          updateQuizProgress(state.quizStep);
          showQuizQuestion(state.quizStep);
        } else {
          document.getElementById('quiz-progress-fill').style.width = '100%';
          document.getElementById('quiz-progress-label').textContent = 'Complete';
          setTimeout(finishQuiz, 300);
        }
      }, 280);
    });
  });

  updateQuizProgress(1);

  // ─── REVEAL ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  function showReveal(styleId) {
    const profile = styles.find(s => s.id === styleId);
    if (!profile) return;

    document.getElementById('reveal-name').textContent = profile.name;
    document.getElementById('reveal-tagline').textContent = profile.tagline;
    document.getElementById('reveal-description').textContent = profile.description;

    const paletteEl = document.getElementById('reveal-palette');
    paletteEl.innerHTML = profile.palette.map((c, i) => `
      <div class="palette-swatch-wrap">
        <span class="palette-swatch" style="background:${c}"></span>
        <span class="palette-swatch-name">${profile.paletteNames[i]}</span>
      </div>
    `).join('');

    const dnaEl = document.getElementById('reveal-dna');
    dnaEl.innerHTML = profile.dna.map(d => `<li>${d}</li>`).join('');

    showPhase('reveal');
  }

  document.getElementById('retake-quiz-btn')?.addEventListener('click', () => {
    state.scores = { 'organic-modern': 0, 'european-modern': 0, 'transitional-modern': 0 };
    state.quizStep = 1;
    state.selectedStyle = null;
    document.querySelectorAll('.answer-btn').forEach(b => b.classList.remove('answer-btn--selected'));
    document.querySelectorAll('.question-block').forEach(el => el.classList.remove('question-block--active'));
    updateQuizProgress(1);
    showQuizQuestion(1);
    showPhase('quiz');
  });
</script>

<style>
  /* ─── Hero ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .selector-hero {
    padding: 6rem 1.5rem 5rem;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-border);
  }
  .selector-hero-inner { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; }

  .hero-content {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 420px;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .hero-moodboard {
    position: sticky;
    top: 88px;
  }
  .hero-moodboard picture { display: block; }
  .hero-moodboard img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    border: 2px solid var(--color-border);
    box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 var(--color-border);
  }
  .moodboard-caption {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    opacity: 0.35;
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    text-align: right;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-brand-red);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .selector-hero h1 { font-size: var(--font-size-h1); margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
  .accent { color: var(--color-brand-red); }
  .hero-sub {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    opacity: 0.7;
    max-width: 620px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .hero-value-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 0;
    border: 2px solid var(--color-border);
  }
  .hero-value-item {
    padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-border);
  }
  .hero-value-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .hero-value-num {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-brand-red);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .hero-value-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }
  .hero-value-desc {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    opacity: 0.7;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* ─── App container ────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .selector-app { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 0 5rem; }

  /* ─── Quiz section header ────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .quiz-section-header {
    padding: 3.5rem 1.5rem 2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }
  .quiz-section-header-inner { max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .quiz-section-header h2 { font-size: var(--font-size-h2); margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  .quiz-section-header p { opacity: 0.7; max-width: 620px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0; }

  /* ─── Quiz progress bar ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .progress-bar-wrap {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    position: sticky;
    top: 64px;
    background-color: var(--color-bg);
    z-index: 9;
  }
